## 스키마/인덱스 초안(요약)

- UserAsset: quantity, avg_cost, current_price, current_value, unrealized_pnl, unrealized_pnl_pct, updated_at
- Portfolio: total_value, cash, invested, unrealized_pnl, realized_pnl, daily_pnl, daily_return, updated_at
- AssetHistory: asset_id, portfolio_id, ts, quantity, price, value, unrealized_pnl
- 인덱스: (portfolio_id), (portfolio_id, category_id), (asset_id, portfolio_id, ts DESC)
- 제약: user_asset 테이블에 Unique(category_id, asset_id) 제안(카테고리 내 중복 금지 규칙 반영)

## API 스펙 초안

- GET `/portfolios/:portfolioId/categories/:categoryId/assets`
  - Query: at, page, limit, sort(value|pnlPct|symbol), dir(asc|desc), minValue, search
  - Response
    - summary: count, totalValue, totalUnrealizedPnl, allocationPct
    - items[]: assetId, symbol, name, quantity, avgCost, price, currentValue, unrealizedPnl, unrealizedPnlPct, allocationPct
- GET `/portfolios/:portfolioId/summary`
  - Query: range(1D|1W|1M|3M|1Y|ALL), at(optional)
  - Response
    - kpis: totalValue, cash, invested, unrealizedPnl, realizedPnl, returnPct, dayChange, dayReturnPct
    - allocationByCategory[]: categoryId, name, value, pct
    - topMovers[]: assetId, symbol, pnlAbs, pnlPct
    - timeseries[]: { ts, totalValue, contribution: { inflow, outflow, pnl } }

